<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Rivals GeoGuesser</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>
    <h1>Rivals GeoGuesser</h1>
    <h2>Rules:</h2>
    <p>
        You will be shown a screenshot from a location in the game, you must guess where the screenshot was taken on the map below. <br>
        The closer you are to the correct position, the more points you will recieve.  <br>
        There will be 5 rounds and your total score will be shown at the end. <br>
        Press Play to begin.
    </p>
    <div class="mainButtons">
        <a href="/play"><button type="button" onclick="reset()">PLAY</button></a>
    </div>

    <script src="rivals.js"></script>
</body>
</html>